      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JILL'S FANTASY (3) flew the lids with a fast early split but ran over at the finish when a narrow fourth (22.71) over 390m at this track. Has winning claims on her best figures. SAINT JADE (6) was well back throughout but attacked the line strongly to score by one length (22.72) at this track in Grade 4/5. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings eight times from 15 starts. One of main contenders. AS PROMISED (8) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 1.75 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 22.42 beating West End Boy. Draws out wide but in form and has the ability. Form from her last run is proving strong. Capable of going well again. SOMETHING GOOD (4) scored in impressive time last start. Must include.",
